      <p>No. 51, 2025</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the <i>Environment Protection and Biodiversity Conservation Act 1999</i>, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>[<i>Assented to 30 October 2025</i>]</p>
      <formula name="enacting">
        <p>The Parliament of Australia enacts:</p>
